## Context
Measured 2026-10-27 (conception/2026-10-27-notes-transport-trial.md, case 6): the main-traceability ruleset covers only
main; the narrow agent token can force-update and delete refs/notes/*, including refs/notes/gate, the record the main
guard and merge trust, and refs/notes/review. A session can rewrite or erase gate evidence after the fact.

## Decision for the author
Options to price: (1) accept and rely on the review-notes tamper detection plus local journals; (2) a forge-side
protection if the forge can target these refs (unverified — rulesets are believed to target branches and tags only);
(3) mirror the notes refs to a second store and compare in the daily audit.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] The author's choice is recorded here.
- [ ] If (2) or (3): implemented and a deletion or force-update of refs/notes/gate by the agent token is refused or detected (measured).
- [ ] The policy doc states which it is.
